{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:dffe50cb745e8f33","name":"Gear Templates","source":{"id":"source:reference-dffe50cb745e8f33","title":"Gear Templates","revision":22258,"timestamp":"2024-09-01T19:32:14Z","sha256":"2084eb1705ce49833f49bd6066ab91c4c519c847ce67ec8f7270dabec738e263","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=22258","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gear%20Templates&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-dffe50cb745e8f33","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Old Republic Era Campaign"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Old_Republic_Era_Campaign"},", a hero might have access to a wide variety of exotic gear with special properties not found in more common types of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"},". Rather than list individual pieces of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," from dozens of different worlds in the galaxy- such as a Bothan Heavy Blaster Pistol or a suit of Arkanian Battle Armor- Gear Templates can be applied to normal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," statistics to produce an unusual version of an item.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["To create an item using a Gear Template, choose a basic piece of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," (such as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Blaster Rifle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Blaster_Rifle","referenceId":"reference:fb78a988cbf9557f"},"), then choose one of the Gear Templates from the sections below. Apply the changes to the Equipment's statistics and effect as described in the Template's description. Some Gear Templates have restrictions, either because of the Gear Template type (for example, Weapon Templates can only be applied to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"},") or because of specific prerequisites (for example, only weapons that deal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stun"}," damage can have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bothan Weapon Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bothan_Weapon_Template","referenceId":"reference:4c20cdd081ded6d8"}," applied).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Gamemasters might rule that some weapons cannot be altered due to cultural or logical prerequisites; for example, since a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Bowcaster"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Bowcaster","referenceId":"reference:e2b6fdac63f81582"}," is a weapon unique to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wookiee"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wookiee","referenceId":"reference:0ac15c44d33f4b95"}," culture, it makes little sense for there to be an Echani Bowcaster.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Introducing Gear Templates"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Introducing Gear Templates into your campaign takes a major step away from the simplicity of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," design, purchase, and use that the ",{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]}," provides. Gear Templates are balanced in that the benefit of a Gear Template also contains certain drawbacks, so heroes still have a reason to pick up a standard ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heavy Blaster Pistol"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heavy_Blaster_Pistol","referenceId":"reference:7fb29dca115dd7cd"}," rather than an Iridonian Heavy Blaster Pistol. Items that have had a Gear Template applied represent rare samples that are found only once in a great while. All Templated items have the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rare"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rare"}," tag applied to their Availability, since they are found only on one planet or in the possession of one particular group.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Gamemasters should be cautious when introducing Gear Templates into the game. Items with Gear Templates applied should not be included in the list of items a character can buy; rather, they must be found or earned. Items with Gear Templates applied make great rewards for completing missions or defeating important villains, but if they can be found in every shop or purchased off a computer shopping network then they are no longer special.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Even when these items are available for purchase, such as buying a suit of Eriadun Flex Armor on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Eriadu"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Eriadu","referenceId":"reference:7dc6c010bb391ad3"},", only one such item will be available, since they are above and beyond the weapons and armor found commonly throughout the galaxy. Unlike the heroes in the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Knights of the Old Republic"]}," video games, your heroes probably should not walk around with unique item on every part of their bodies. Instead, treat these special items as exceptional rewards or prized finds.\n"]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["General Templates"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gear Templates denoting a particular place or method of manufacturing might cover both ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"},". The following General Templates can be applied to suits of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Armor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Armor"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapons"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapons"},", using the rules described in the Template's entry.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["TEMPLATE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["APPLICABLE TO\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SOURCE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Arkanian General Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Arkanian_General_Template","referenceId":"reference:1b4458cf331a93d6"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Armor; Ranged Weapons (Energy)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Cinnagaran General Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cinnagaran_General_Template","referenceId":"reference:c5144e7ede65a745"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Armor; Ranged Weapons (Energy)\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Weave/Phrik Alloy General Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Weave/Phrik_Alloy_General_Template","referenceId":"reference:a2d70c9a2a420be5"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Armor; Weapons\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]}]},"\n",{"t