Abomination Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Sith_Abomination_Template"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["The ancient Sith who first discovered alchemical secrets learned to manipulate the genetic structure of living creatures, even sentient ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Stacking Templates"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The templates presented in this chapter are meant to represent the unique products of various societies and cultures. Stacking one template on top of another will inevitably produce weapons and armor far superior to other weapons, possibly creating conflicting results (what is a suit of Massassi Eriadun Armor?).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Therefore, with the exception of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prototype General Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prototype_General_Template","referenceId":"reference:9535d58772eeab53"}," and the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Cortosis Weave/Phrik Alloy General Template"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Cortosis_Weave/Phrik_Alloy_General_Template","referenceId":"reference:a2d70c9a2a420be5"},", no items should have more than one template added. Gamemasters might remove this restriction for special items, but this can quickly affect the way mundane equipment is perceived in your campaign. Additionally, when determining the costs for items with multiple templates, apply each template one at a time, starting with the most expensive template and adding new ones after determining the new price for the item based on the previous template.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
